BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Sourdough from Scratch with Monica Flaherty at Gold Ridge Organic 
 Farms
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261107T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261107T130000
UID:efd5a0525aa2ae6efc40b61e18d33710@growthzone.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a 3-hour hands-on sourdough making class at Gold R
 idge Organic Farms\, led by Monica Flaherty of the Sebastopol Sourdough Co
 mpany. Spend three immersive hours in our charming Apple Cottage learning 
 the art and science of sourdough bread making. Monica will walk you throug
 h everything you need to know — how wild yeast and fermentation work\, w
 hy sourdough differs from commercial yeast bread\, and how to read your do
 ugh. You'll also cover starter care and feeding\, mixing and hydration rat
 ios\, shaping and scoring techniques\, and the secrets to achieving that p
 erfect crust and open crumb. Every guest will leave with an active starter
 \, a feeding schedule and care guide\, a shaped dough in a banneton ready 
 to bake at home\, and their very own apron to take home as a keepsake. The
  experience also includes a ride across the farm on our beloved apple-them
 ed trolley to the Apple Cottage.
URL:https://business.sebastopol.org/events/details/sourdough-from-scratch-
 with-monica-flaherty-at-gold-ridge-organic-farms
X-SOURCE:Sebastopol Chamber of Commerce
END:VEVENT
