UID:20dabf0a227ea9f5b5e59bc23c7e40ed@growthzone.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us as we welcome James Beard Award-winning pastry chef Em
 ily Luchetti to our Farm Shop as she samples her Sweet Queen line of artis
 anal fruit spreads and caramels. Entry is free (no need to RSVP) Emily wil
 l show you how her flavors pair with other local\, seasonal favorites\, an
 d how to use them to elevate your holiday menus and festive gatherings. In
  addition to being a treat for your tastebuds\, these exceptional products
  make perfect holiday gifts for friends and family.
