BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Latkes\, Light & Luncheon: A Cooking Class with Stephanie Klassen 
 Rosenbaum at Gold Ridge Organic Farms
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261204T103000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261204T130000
UID:f252b66e7aca8a9a6cf7ad8307f3ce7a@growthzone.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a seasonal cooking experience celebrating the Fest
 ival of Lights that brings together the best of holiday tradition and wint
 er warmth. In this immersive lunch-and-learn\, Stephanie Klassen Rosenbaum
  will teach you step-by-step how to achieve the perfect crispy\, golden po
 tato latke paired with homemade applesauce. She will also share her secret
 s for crafting a deeply flavorful beet borscht and demonstrate how to elev
 ate simple autumn side dishes—like roasted squash—with our very own aw
 ard-winning balsamic vinegar. After learning the techniques\, you’ll gat
 her at a cozy communal table to feast on all the dishes prepared. We'll fi
 nish the afternoon on a sweet note with a slice of warm\, flaky pie crafte
 d by Red Bird Bakery\, featuring Gold Ridge Organic Farms heirloom apples.
  What to Expect: • A scenic ride in our apple-themed trolley from the Fa
 rm Shop to the Apple Cottage • A step-by-step cooking demonstration insi
 de our Apple Cottage kitchen (no cooking required on your part!) 
URL:https://business.sebastopol.org/events/details/latkes-light-luncheon-a
 -cooking-class-with-stephanie-klassen-rosenbaum-at-gold-ridge-organic-farm
 s
X-SOURCE:Sebastopol Chamber of Commerce
END:VEVENT
