SUMMARY:Celebratory Toasts!
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261121T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261122T160000
UID:886c7a5c1c201fe8bfa2e91f12e822e8@growthzone.com
DESCRIPTION:There's always something worth raising a glass to! Join Taste 
 Route 116 on November 21 & 22 for Celebratory Toasts\, a weekend of wine\,
  food\, and connection along the beautiful backroads of Russian River Vall
 ey. As the season of gathering begins\, we invite you to celebrate life's 
 special moments with us\, big and small! Explore 10 family-owned wineries 
 throughout West Sonoma County\, each featuring a specially crafted crostin
 i toast bite paired with a favorite fall wine. Along the way\, discover hi
 dden gems\, meet the people behind the pours\, and enjoy the warm hospital
 ity that makes our wine country community so special. Gather your favorite
  people\, follow the backroads\, and make a weekend of it!
URL:https://business.sebastopol.org/events/details/celebratory-toasts
X-SOURCE:Sebastopol Chamber of Commerce
END:VEVENT
